{"id":"marketing-services-and-materials-form-xml-d336dd5f","title":"marketing-services-and-materials-form-xml-d336dd5f","format":"xml","sections":[{"path":"impostazioni","title":"Impostazioni (FormConfig)","level":1,"page":null,"paragraphs":[],"tables":[{"caption":"impostazioni","headers":["Parametro","Valore"],"rows":[["VersionDescription",""],["AdditionalInformation",""],["SearchableKeyword","Marketing Services and Materials"],["Title","Marketing Services"],["FormType","Marketing"],["LimitSupplierSelection","true"]]}],"figures":[],"kind":"config-export"},{"path":"struttura","title":"Sezioni e gruppi del form","level":1,"page":null,"paragraphs":[],"tables":[{"caption":"gruppi","headers":["Gruppo","Titolo","Sezione"],"rows":[["Product List","Product List","Product List"],["Order Form","Order Form","Order Form"],["Supplier Information","Supplier Information","Supplier Information"],["Other Information","Other Information","Other Information"]]}],"figures":[],"kind":"config-export"},{"path":"campi-1","title":"Campi — Order Form","level":1,"page":null,"paragraphs":[],"tables":[{"caption":"campi","headers":["Nome tecnico","Campo","Tipo","Obbligatorio","Gruppo","Sola lettura","Lunghezza massima","Convalide","Note"],"rows":[["Order Form100","Order Form","ItemList","No","Order Form","false","","","Order Form · UserDefinedFieldParamFormListId=248343 · id=10010 · tipo=userdefined"]]}],"figures":[],"kind":"config-export","records":[{"kind":"element","name":"10010","internal_name":"Order Form100","title":"Order Form","group":"Order Form","element_type":"userdefined","field_type":"ItemList","mandatory":"No","read_only":"false","max_length":null,"validations":[]}]},{"path":"campi-2","title":"Campi — Product List","level":1,"page":null,"paragraphs":[],"tables":[{"caption":"campi","headers":["Nome tecnico","Campo","Tipo","Obbligatorio","Gruppo","Sola lettura","Lunghezza massima","Convalide","Note"],"rows":[["Visitor's Guide200","Visitor's Guide","HTML","No","Product List","false","","","Visitor's Guide · UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=The <b>Visitor's Guide</b> is an extensive introduction to the University; its campus and the city of CollegeTown. It provides helpful and detailed information to newcomers, visitors, prospective students and their parents, prospective faculty and staff as well as Univ. Healthcare visitors. This guide provides campus highlights and its nearby amenities and services. Included in this 8.5 by 11 inch, full-color booklet is an illustrated, color-coded campus map.<b> Price - No Charge</b> Available for PDF download: <a href=\"http://communications.emory.edu/documents/marketing/Visitor_Guide_2011.pdf\">2011 Visitor's Guide</a> · id=10012 · tipo=userdefined"],["Pocket Map 200","Pocket Map","HTML","No","Product List","false","","","Pocket Map · UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=The <b>Pocket Map</b> highlights 35 of our most-visited buildings, provides key fact about the University, and features a transportation map on the reverse side. The map is small in size but big in detail, providing a three-dimensional view of campus buildings. Portable and practical, this map is ideal for a quick orientation for campus visitors. For those with mobile devices, included are QR codes linking you to University Mobile and Transloc (the Cliff shuttle app). The map folds down to 2 1/8&quot; x 3 1/4&quot;, with a full size of 12 1/4&quot; x 6 1/4&quot;. <b>Price - [importo]</b> · id=10031 · tipo=userdefined"],["Presentation Folder 200","Presentation Folder","HTML","No","Product List","false","","","Presentation Folder · UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=The <b>Presentation Folder</b> is a lightweight folder that measures 9 ½ x 12”. Specially designed to present University materials in a very attractive manner; the folder holds letter-sized documents in two inside pockets and has cardholder slots precut. University’s vision statement is imprinted on the left pocket. <b>Price - $.72</b> · id=10033 · tipo=userdefined"],["Campus Map","Campus Map","HTML","No","Product List","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=The <b>Campus Map</b> is an advertising-supported brochure that contains a map of academic buildings, residence halls and parking structures across campus. It also includes a map of colleges and universities in the Atlanta area. This piece measures 4”x9”. <b>Price – No charge</b> · id=10250 · tipo=userdefined"],["Facts and Figures","Facts and Figures Brochure","HTML","No","Product List","false","","","Facts and Figures Brochure · UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=With impressive economy, the <b>Facts and Figures Brochure </b>provides some of the most commonly requested information about University’s people, schools, and resources—including enrollment, faculty, and staff data, as well as financial and academic support information. The new design features an elegant twenty-page booklet with maps of the Atlanta and Oxford campuses tucked inside the back cover. Additionally, Facts & Figures contains a list of the University's points of distinction along with updated statistical information. <b><font color=\"red\">New Price - [importo]</font></b> · id=10015 · tipo=userdefined"],["Interact with University","","HTML","No","Product List","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=<font color=\"red\">NEW</font>&nbsp&nbsp<b>Interact with University</b> is a PDF with live links that puts all of the University’s ample news sources at your fingertips. This interactive resource provides you with information about the University wherever you are. Whether you are in your home, office, or on the go, use this tool to find out what’s going at the University. <b>Price - No Charge</b> <a href=\"http://communications.emory.edu/documents/marketing/interact-live-links.pdf\">Download your PDF copy now.</a> · id=10261 · tipo=userdefined"],["Other","","HTML","No","Product List","false","","","UserDefinedFieldParamHTML=<b>The images shown below are not to scale. · id=10036 · tipo=userdefined"]]}],"figures":[],"kind":"config-export","records":[{"kind